2           RETAIN THE FIRST OBSERVATION IN EACH BY GROUP AND SAVE REMOVED ROWS
                                                           The SAS System

3               This program keeps only the first row for each unique value of a variable.
4               Keywords: PROC SORT, remove duplicates
5               SAS Versions: SAS 9, SAS Viya
6               Documentation:
