6        ! .htm
7               1. Create the WORK.CLASSTEST table and print it.
8               2. The first PROC SORT arranges rows by desending scores for each Name and Subject.
9               3. The second PROC SORT keeps only the first occurence of each Name and Subject combination.
10                 The DUPOUT= options saves rows that are removed in a separate table named CLASSTEST_DUPS.
11         ************************************************************************************************/
